    applicationMd: "**Step 1:** Visit the official MoWCD internship portal at [wcd.intern.nic.in](http://wcd.intern.nic.in/).\n**Step 2:** Click **'Register'** and create your account with your email and mobile number.\n**Step 3:** Log in and fill in the online application form — personal details, educational qualification, organisation/institution, area of interest (child welfare, women empowerment, etc.).\n**Step 4:** Upload: proof of enrollment or employment, a brief Statement of Purpose (SOP) explaining your interest, ID proof, and residence proof showing you are from a non-tier-1 city/rural area.\n**Step 5:** Submit before the cycle deadline. Shortlisted applicants are informed by email and asked to report to MoWCD's New Delhi office.",
